// app.at — p1 v5(RED 复刻):App 以 T18 概要卡形态(button+key+onclick+嵌套
// row/col)二消费 view_groups,SidePanel 按条件渲染成员。
// RED = press 后 SidePanel 的 if g.open 成员仍渲染(os-config ③)。
use groups_store: GroupsStore
use side_panel: SidePanel

widget App {
    msg { Init, SelectMod(str) }

    model {
        var active str = ""
    }

    view {
        col {
            style: "p-6 font-sans space-y-4"
            for g in .store.view_groups {
                button (class: "ov-card w-full text-left flex items-start gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-[#e0e0e0] bg-white", key: g.id) {
                                        row (style: "flex flex-row items-center gap-3 w-full") {
                        span (text: g.label, style: "text-2xl shrink-0") {}
                        col (style: "ov-text flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-[0px]") {
                            text (text: g.label, style: "text-sm font-semibold") {}
                            text (text: g.m1, style: "text-xs") {}
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            SidePanel { }
        }
    }

    on {
        .Init -> { store.Init() }
        .SelectMod(id) -> { .active = id }
    }
}
